{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/21/9976023/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブ セカンド・シーズン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スペシャル公演も含めた\n全18公演終了しました✳︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終わってしまえば\nあっという間だったなあ～っ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回ね、友達やら先生やら\n総勢20名程観に来てくれたの♡\nありがたいよね:;(∩´﹏`∩);:♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てことでセトリを追いながら\n感想書くね＼(^o^)／♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/21/9976023/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの日 僕は咄嗟に嘘をついた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて自分のポジションのある曲！\nただただ楽しい♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/21/9976023/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここにいる理由"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/21/9976023/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンスパート①"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/21/9976023/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"狼に口笛を"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/21/9976023/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"制服のマネキン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌って踊るのが楽しくて楽しくて\nどうしても笑顔になっちゃうんだけど\nここのパートはカッコ良く\nきめたくて研究しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだだけど、\n前よりは成長できたかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/21/9976023/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハウス！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/21/9976023/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガールズルール"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/21/9976023/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会いたかったかもしれない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/21/9976023/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンケシェーン(二期生)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/21/9976023/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のジャンプ力(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/21/9976023/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ザキ子が怪我で見学に来てた時に\n撮ってくれてたダンケシェーン！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二期生だけで披露しました！\n上手さとかよりも全力さで\n頑張りましたーっ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/21/9976023/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"涙がまだ悲しみだった頃(一期生)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/21/9976023/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"失いたくないから\n(or心の薬orやさしさとは)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/21/9976023/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"千秋楽は涙が止まらなかったなあ。"},{"type"