","text":"初恋のイントロでの曲紹介が\nとてつもなく好き...♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"✳︎アンコール✳︎"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/21/9976023/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何度目の青空か？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/21/9976023/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"13日の金曜日"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/21/9976023/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂の詩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木詩ってやっぱりいい曲！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく楽しかったっ!\nやっぱり私はライブが好きなんだなあ\nって思いました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のアンダーライブは\n各界いろーんな方が\n観に来てくださって、\n注目度も高まってるんだなあ\nと嬉しかったです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/21/9976023/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こじ坂に入れなかったのは\nとっても残念(´･ω･｀) ♡\nじゃんけん負けたよ(´･ω･｀) (笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもこじはるさんからの差し入れは\nちゃっかりいただきました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/10/21/9976023/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブ、\nいつかは大きいところで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って思っていたけど\nこれくらいの大きさだからこその\n良さもあるわけで、\n乃木坂全体のライブは\n大きいところでやらせて頂けてるから